                "text": "\u201cThe attorney\u2019s refusal to attend comes as Gov.\u00a0Ron DeSantis and Attorney General James Uthmeier mount a legalistic defense of the use of what seemed to be public money for a political campaign, regarding $10 million directed to the Hope Florida Foundation in a Medicaid settlement.\u201d",
